<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-27T23:53:32.656Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:53:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador has deployed hundreds of troops and special forces to Haiti to search for four missing Salvadoran soldiers and four kidnapped aviation technicians after a gang ambush, while President Bukele says recovered remains are not those personnel. Haitian gangs have stepped up attacks, forcing civilians to flee the communes of Petite Rivière de l'Artibonite and Arcahaie and launching a major assault on UN-backed troops, which the UN chief condemned after 47 troops were killed. The Dominican Republic has reinforced its southern frontier and border with Haiti in response to the heightened violence. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPV1FsRG13WUFFS1B2SUUwZ0prZzlWX1I2NE9jT2pqY0w3RWNoMG14NVIyWlVrNG4yZ0x0WFBBRXRFQkRaY0U1ZWlhdzRqZHZWWWhyRG9MNzBkQllQejE3U2RteWF1VU1nWk1FS1YtakRKSk9HV0otNGNlUUhSRVp4WlRZMWx4TmloUkF5anlWS0JPTWNTN1cxQVpJOTBhQ283dTBvMlJFZnlUUGVKQWNqdDFRZnVFS0Z0WnFxUktPR1R4VDFW?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPX3A0Z2dMclpLeWNSOTRfeVh3cXhTMWhnRnpwNEhnaXZXWl8tV3BKOFFZN25pWWtYS3NlNnRkd3FET0RhWlhPcFVNckQ1RW5sMldrRjQtMzY0ZDhJaXlDeDBsT1NsUF95NjFqRUFldXV2S055SjZkUjh1d2c2a3cwQjQwd1FEU1JNY1dXR3pwdUl1Uks0aWpUSXN6RFM0QzJ6VFBqb0F2YUhJa2ZfQ0ZOWHM0Mk5LckRv?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPN3N0enNCa0pOSjQzZ0ZLcmJtZEdvY0JFNl95NkRWSkZOUGkwb0FLTmRCOWRGVEthTE1OZ0NHbjZkOUNMRFA3LU8tR1NSUVFwRVYybVl4N28ydjRGVU9sWUFWdF8xZE0zZzRwekE4UHpURnFLZjNmVnRCNURtOFhaOTh2bmQtcEN1MXdnS05HYVg3OVNQVDVVOFVUclVFMzQ0N1h0dnVydmsyT2hBNFY2bzFkd0xfNElWWGc4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPaUVfcHo5QnJBR1pkQ0swO